WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:57.550 --> 01:58.980
She's like a butterfly.

02:05.390 --> 02:06.250
Who are you?

02:10.560 --> 02:12.990
Where did you come from?

02:14.760 --> 02:15.920
What are you doing?

02:23.470 --> 02:24.670
She's weird.

02:26.980 --> 02:31.910
Our Fox Deity, Perseveres

02:43.360 --> 02:45.450
Have you ever felt lonely?

02:45.690 --> 02:47.350
Shiro-chan!

02:47.800 --> 02:50.490
There we go. Are you okay?

03:03.380 --> 03:05.540
Team C here. No change sighted.

03:05.850 --> 03:09.150
Confirmed. Continue surveillance.

03:09.520 --> 03:10.250
Understood.

03:13.860 --> 03:15.410
Is she really going to come?

03:15.920 --> 03:17.020
Beats me.

03:25.500 --> 03:26.930
You've gotten much better, Ko!

03:27.740 --> 03:29.760
You salted everything just right!

03:30.210 --> 03:31.430
Thank you.

03:31.640 --> 03:33.630
Salt is like your thing, right?

03:33.810 --> 03:36.040
Actually, it's like you're made of salt.

03:46.690 --> 03:47.850
It was just a dream...

04:12.850 --> 04:14.280
What are you doing?

04:16.620 --> 04:17.310
Nothing.

04:18.750 --> 04:20.450
Are you going for a walk again?

04:20.720 --> 04:21.620
Something like that.

04:21.920 --> 04:23.080
I see.

04:23.890 --> 04:25.650
I have to go clean up now...

04:35.370 --> 04:36.740
I'll go to the store now.

04:37.070 --> 04:38.270
Thanks.

04:43.580 --> 04:45.210
Excuse me!

04:48.850 --> 04:53.120
Wow, Takagami. You don't
look half bad in those glasses.

04:53.320 --> 04:56.220
I wonder if he didn't have time to
put on his contacts this morning.

04:56.660 --> 05:01.150
Well, he is living with two pretty girls.
He's probably restless every single morning.

05:02.160 --> 05:05.560
Ko-chan could go wake him
up like they're newlyweds...

05:06.000 --> 05:10.160
Or Tenko-san could be wandering
around half-asleep in her underwear!

05:10.740 --> 05:12.760
No!

05:13.710 --> 05:15.900
C-Calm down.

05:17.980 --> 05:18.950
Takagami.

05:20.150 --> 05:22.640
The badminton club's only going
to have a quick meeting today.

05:24.350 --> 05:27.810
Anyway, you know how the
club's going to end early?

05:27.960 --> 05:29.650
I was thinking that maybe we could...

05:29.890 --> 05:31.630
Which one to pick...

05:31.630 --> 05:33.420
Yeah, you'll have to pick...

05:35.030 --> 05:37.930
Is he talking about Tenko-san and Ko-chan?

05:38.070 --> 05:43.970
Is he playing with his cell so much because
he double-booked them on dates?!

05:44.440 --> 05:46.000
I'll go with both.

05:46.240 --> 05:48.640
There's no rule that says you can't have both!

05:49.810 --> 05:51.400
No way!

05:52.150 --> 05:54.810
Does that mean?

05:56.320 --> 05:58.150
Takagami! Don't be a two-timer!

05:58.990 --> 05:59.950
Sakura?

06:01.760 --> 06:04.090
Can you keep it down?

06:04.230 --> 06:07.750
It's embarrassing to run between two
supermarkets because of different bargains.

06:08.960 --> 06:11.660
Anyway, I'm going to skip today's club meeting.

06:12.070 --> 06:12.930
Sakura-san?

06:29.780 --> 06:31.910
I did it!

06:32.120 --> 06:33.520
What are you doing?

06:33.690 --> 06:35.160
"Chi-chan's Shadow Projection."

06:35.160 --> 06:36.450
What?

06:36.560 --> 06:38.720
We read about it in Japanese class, remember?

06:39.030 --> 06:43.190
Stare at your shadow for 10 seconds
without blinking and then look at the sky...

06:43.830 --> 06:46.930
My shadow's in the sky!

06:48.240 --> 06:49.870
You sure that's not just an afterimage?

06:49.870 --> 06:54.100
Why are you so cynical?
What happened to you, man?

06:54.640 --> 06:56.740
Give it a try, Toru. It's addicting.

06:57.180 --> 06:57.940
I'll just watch.

06:58.150 --> 06:58.940
Oh.

07:01.350 --> 07:04.410
Toru, can you put your hands on
your hips and stand over there?

07:06.120 --> 07:07.920
Come on, hurry!

07:08.060 --> 07:10.160
What now?

07:10.160 --> 07:11.430
Hurry!

07:11.430 --> 07:14.160
Now face this way and put
your hands on your hips.

07:14.300 --> 07:15.960
Come on, Handa. The Shadow Projection.

07:15.960 --> 07:16.620
Sure.

07:17.670 --> 07:19.230
Face. Face. Face.

07:19.230 --> 07:20.060
Face?

07:21.200 --> 07:22.670
That was so stupid!

07:23.810 --> 07:25.740
Yeah, it is.

07:26.070 --> 07:28.540
I used to do that, too.

07:28.680 --> 07:33.880
Shimenogi, are you sure our target isn't
getting farther away while we're doing this?

07:34.020 --> 07:37.040
Another team will be on it if that's the case.

07:37.490 --> 07:41.510
Our job right now is to
watch Takagami Toru-kun.

07:41.660 --> 07:42.710
Uh-huh.

07:42.990 --> 07:46.930
If there's even a small chance the target
will come here, we should just wait.

07:47.330 --> 07:51.560
Even if it might end up being a waste,
we work together as a team.

07:51.800 --> 07:53.730
I like the sound of that!

07:54.040 --> 07:56.330
But it's already been 3 days!

07:56.500 --> 07:58.940
If the target is going to appear,
it should be about time!

07:59.110 --> 08:00.470
I agree.

08:01.240 --> 08:02.330
I guess.

08:02.780 --> 08:04.870
Oh, right. It's already been 3 days...

08:05.280 --> 08:08.680
That means it's the 3rd day Boss is bedridden...

08:08.850 --> 08:11.720
Oh? Enju is bedridden?

08:11.820 --> 08:13.290
- Yeah.
- I'm so worried about her...

08:14.190 --> 08:16.090
The baku is coming!

08:16.160 --> 08:18.630
Azuma, don't look! You'll!

08:20.830 --> 08:22.800
Don't worry.

08:23.100 --> 08:25.070
This isn't enchanted anymore.

08:25.530 --> 08:26.500
You got scared for nothing.

08:27.670 --> 08:29.470
The Kugen fox!

08:29.900 --> 08:31.370
Now then...

08:31.710 --> 08:38.170
Your bedridden boss said
we would never meet again.

08:38.750 --> 08:40.710
It hasn't even been a week.

08:43.050 --> 08:47.710
I'm disgusted at how quick you
people go against your word...

08:47.990 --> 08:50.420
But I assume you have your own reasons.

08:51.030 --> 08:55.390
You're making me think it's
related to the Byakki again.

08:58.330 --> 09:01.060
Seems like my guess isn't that far off.

09:01.400 --> 09:03.430
Just tell me and get it over with.

09:03.840 --> 09:06.900
If your reasons are legitimate, I might let you go.

09:11.750 --> 09:12.640
We can't say.

09:14.050 --> 09:17.280
Is that how it's going to be?

09:17.450 --> 09:20.480
Fine. Then say your prayers while you still can.

09:21.860 --> 09:25.760
You've been snooping around
Toru for the past 3 days.

09:26.130 --> 09:31.390
I didn't smell any danger so I ignored you,
but you're starting to become a nuisance.

09:31.700 --> 09:35.860
The next time I see you,
I will remove you by force...

09:35.970 --> 09:38.100
No, I'll erase you.

09:42.110 --> 09:44.270
Misaki-chan!

09:45.850 --> 09:47.140
Miyabe-san?

09:47.280 --> 09:49.010
Do you have a minute?

09:49.250 --> 09:50.620
There's something I want to ask you.

09:50.920 --> 09:52.410
Sure, what's up?

09:52.990 --> 09:55.220
I'm wondering if Noboru-kun has a girlfriend.

10:01.200 --> 10:02.660
I don't think he does.

10:02.730 --> 10:04.860
Really? That's great!

10:05.930 --> 10:09.130
Why do you ask?

10:09.500 --> 10:13.440
Because Noboru-kun always smells so delicious...

10:13.440 --> 10:15.030
I simply couldn't help but notice him!

10:15.380 --> 10:16.100
Excuse me?

10:16.910 --> 10:19.110
What's she talking about? Pheromones?

10:19.410 --> 10:22.950
Pheromones or something
are coming out of Takagami?

10:22.950 --> 10:26.520
So that's why he attracts so many girls...

10:26.520 --> 10:27.890
Wait, I'm different!

10:27.990 --> 10:31.020
I like Takagami because he's so kind.

10:31.660 --> 10:32.990
Thanks, Misaki-chan.

10:33.230 --> 10:33.890
Bye now.

10:37.670 --> 10:40.570
What's with her? I'll show her!

10:44.370 --> 10:46.470
That fox was scary...

10:46.770 --> 10:48.260
Yeah...

10:48.410 --> 10:53.040
Shimenogi-san, I'm surprised you were
able to talk to him. I wouldn't be able to.

10:54.580 --> 10:59.420
Well, I do think he's someone
you can negotiate with.

10:59.820 --> 11:03.150
The really scary ones are the kind
you can't communicate with.

11:03.690 --> 11:05.720
Oh, really.

11:06.290 --> 11:08.420
I'm just repeating what Naguma-san said.

11:11.370 --> 11:15.890
She's here. Come here and take a look, Chief.

11:16.240 --> 11:17.700
Yeah, I guess.

11:18.340 --> 11:19.030
All right!

11:21.540 --> 11:23.570
So we're starting on our operation!

11:30.850 --> 11:33.620
Azuma, contact headquarters...

12:04.120 --> 12:06.850
What was I doing?

12:07.760 --> 12:09.950
I feel so weak...

12:10.730 --> 12:11.890
Boss!

12:22.440 --> 12:24.200
What's going on?

12:41.190 --> 12:42.210
Where is the Byakki?

12:43.260 --> 12:44.420
Boss!

12:44.760 --> 12:47.490
I'm glad you're finally awake!

12:47.860 --> 12:50.560
Sainoki, what happened to the Byakki?

12:50.930 --> 12:53.590
What happened after that? What did I?

12:53.800 --> 12:55.930
Please stay calm, Boss.

12:56.400 --> 12:58.390
I'll explain everything.

12:58.870 --> 13:03.440
I remember removing the
enchanted cloth on the Byakki...

13:04.450 --> 13:06.940
...and freeing her physical constraints.

13:07.880 --> 13:11.550
The Byakki then returned to her original form.

13:13.420 --> 13:17.320
Being the closest one there,
the Byakki grabbed my arm.

13:17.990 --> 13:22.020
I don't know why, but I lost
all my strength soon after.

13:27.600 --> 13:32.230
The ability of the Byakki to absorb
life energies wasn't just a legend.

13:35.810 --> 13:36.640
Yes.

13:37.080 --> 13:40.600
It appears your life force
was absorbed excessively.

13:41.020 --> 13:43.950
Most of the others woke up in under an hour...

13:45.250 --> 13:46.480
Hold on!

13:46.720 --> 13:48.810
How long was I asleep?

13:51.060 --> 13:52.080
3 days.

13:55.700 --> 13:56.920
But rest assured.

13:58.170 --> 14:01.690
We have continued our search
for the Byakki the past 3 days.

14:02.300 --> 14:06.360
We've also just received a report of her sighting!

14:06.510 --> 14:07.410
Is that true?

14:07.680 --> 14:11.670
Yes. All available hands are headed that way.

14:12.050 --> 14:13.510
I see...

14:20.620 --> 14:22.210
Can we really catch her?

14:22.720 --> 14:24.280
You mean the Byakki?

14:24.490 --> 14:28.020
We were helpless against the
Byakki when she just awoke.

14:29.400 --> 14:30.830
How will we be able to?

14:31.330 --> 14:33.390
It's all right. We can do it.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.560
We might not be able to.

14:36.100 --> 14:38.160
I was rejected by the Byakki.

14:39.410 --> 14:43.400
That means I'm not worthy of
becoming the lord of the oni.

14:43.910 --> 14:45.500
No, we will capture her!

14:48.750 --> 14:52.150
We will capture her even
if it may costs us our lives!

14:52.890 --> 14:54.620
For you!

14:59.560 --> 15:01.530
Thank you, Sainoki.

15:02.000 --> 15:03.160
Boss...

15:07.000 --> 15:09.940
I will fulfill my duty as the lord!

15:11.110 --> 15:13.900
Call Inamochi here.

15:16.880 --> 15:16.910
Class Records

15:16.910 --> 15:18.570
Class Records
Good.

15:19.250 --> 15:21.510
Did you write on the blackboard
for the next person on daily duty?

15:21.720 --> 15:22.940
I forgot about that!

15:23.080 --> 15:26.950
Oh? Then you'll have to be on
daily duty again tomorrow.

15:27.350 --> 15:29.120
I'll go do it right now!

15:29.260 --> 15:30.780
Okay, bye-bye!

15:30.990 --> 15:32.480
Be careful on your way home!

15:34.260 --> 15:35.920
Bye!

15:37.670 --> 15:41.120
I'll come through here on my way back anyway.

15:47.340 --> 15:49.410
I found some great bargains.

15:49.410 --> 15:52.880
I got the eggs, onions, and
the timed sale for chicken.

15:52.880 --> 15:54.970
Maybe I should make omelets with rice today.

15:55.680 --> 15:58.620
I hope Toru feels better after some good food.

15:59.250 --> 16:01.810
I don't blame him for being so down.

16:02.360 --> 16:05.290
He and Shiro-chan were really getting along.

16:08.460 --> 16:09.930
Excuse me, Noboru-sama.

16:10.760 --> 16:11.560
Well...

16:12.330 --> 16:14.430
The white thing was in the yard today.

16:14.570 --> 16:16.630
What do you mean?

16:17.770 --> 16:20.330
Well, um...

16:20.570 --> 16:23.100
This fluttery...

16:23.210 --> 16:25.270
Uh-huh. Fluttery.

16:25.550 --> 16:27.280
Is it dangerous?

16:28.550 --> 16:31.040
No. I did not sense any malicious intent.

16:31.250 --> 16:32.340
Then it should be fine.

16:32.520 --> 16:35.720
Anyway, can you help me make dinner, Ko?

16:38.660 --> 16:39.220
Sure!

16:44.370 --> 16:46.630
Did she just smile?

16:53.070 --> 16:56.370
Hello there, lord of the oni.

16:57.380 --> 17:00.070
Hello. How have you been doing?

17:00.280 --> 17:01.270
Not bad.

17:01.750 --> 17:06.690
Anyways, I heard from Tomine. It must have
been terrible for the Byakki to escape.

17:08.090 --> 17:10.660
Don't look at me like that.

17:10.660 --> 17:14.150
You called me here because you
want an item now. Isn't that right?

17:14.630 --> 17:15.250
Yes.

17:15.760 --> 17:19.890
You're a regular client.
I'll be sure to get you something good.

17:23.340 --> 17:25.100
Okay, done.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.800
Shiro-chan?!

17:36.980 --> 17:41.080
I guess she wouldn't be here...

17:50.460 --> 17:53.590
Wh-What?

17:54.130 --> 17:56.500
Wh-Who are you?!

18:01.310 --> 18:03.470
No way. It can't be.

18:06.110 --> 18:08.270
Shiro-chan?

18:12.090 --> 18:13.920
H-Hey, wait!

18:19.460 --> 18:23.520
Takagami Toru-san. We need
you to return the Byakki to us!

18:30.000 --> 18:31.870
They just don't know when to quit!

18:32.210 --> 18:34.140
Setting aside the other oni...

18:35.240 --> 18:37.970
Do you think you can win
against her on your own?

18:38.510 --> 18:40.450
I have no intention of fighting that.

18:40.750 --> 18:42.920
I'm only going to beat up the oni.

18:42.920 --> 18:44.940
So you're not going to protect Toru-kun?

18:45.290 --> 18:48.520
That's Shiro. She won't hurt Toru.

18:48.620 --> 18:50.650
Yes, maybe not directly.

18:50.890 --> 18:54.880
But staying with her will also
cause Toru-kun to be chased after.

18:55.260 --> 18:57.630
You don't want that, do you?

19:00.030 --> 19:02.190
If you'd like, how about we cooperate?

19:03.040 --> 19:05.100
Do you know who Shiro is?

19:05.710 --> 19:06.730
More than you do.

19:07.980 --> 19:10.240
Do you know what the oni are after, too?

19:10.940 --> 19:12.000
More than you do.

19:12.410 --> 19:17.480
Oh, and another thing. Even if you didn't come,
we'd go after Toru-kun.

19:17.850 --> 19:19.510
We have a reason to do so.

19:23.160 --> 19:24.490
Who are you?

19:27.590 --> 19:30.560
I introduced myself to you in the past.

19:31.170 --> 19:33.260
I'm not going to do it a second time.

19:33.970 --> 19:36.130
You just need to remember who I am.

19:37.470 --> 19:39.530
Well, let's get going.

19:48.280 --> 19:49.750
This is the 3rd floor!

20:14.610 --> 20:17.200
It's time to retreat.
We'll have to rendezvous with reinforcements!

20:20.650 --> 20:22.080
Shiro-chan, no!

20:24.420 --> 20:26.820
You shouldn't hurt them!

20:28.060 --> 20:30.520
Shiro-chan, wait right there! You got that?!

20:31.120 --> 20:31.850
Retreat!

20:32.060 --> 20:33.250
Yes, sir!

20:36.130 --> 20:37.120
Shiro-chan...

20:37.630 --> 20:43.370
The Byakki ran away from us.

20:43.570 --> 20:46.730
And she came back to you.

20:48.410 --> 20:51.210
She must like you.

20:53.380 --> 20:55.580
She came looking for me.

20:56.520 --> 20:59.420
She came because she didn't
want to be with Enju-san!

21:00.650 --> 21:02.210
I have to do something!

21:22.240 --> 21:28.700
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:29.180 --> 21:36.380
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:37.760 --> 21:44.250
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:44.400 --> 21:52.030
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

21:52.940 --> 21:59.970
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

22:00.550 --> 22:07.040
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

22:07.290 --> 22:14.700
Daijoubu bokura ha hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:14.700 --> 22:22.340
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:22.340 --> 22:30.010
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:30.010 --> 22:41.220
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:49.360 --> 22:52.670
The air is dirty and it's crowded with humans.

22:52.670 --> 22:55.290
I don't understand how Kugen can live here.

22:55.600 --> 22:58.900
Gyokuyo-sama, why are you doing this?

23:00.310 --> 23:02.330
I might just be lonely.

23:02.640 --> 23:03.730
Lonely?

23:04.950 --> 23:07.310
Or maybe because I'm happy.

23:07.410 --> 23:09.350
I don't exactly know why.

23:12.890 --> 23:16.050
Princess Enju and Tomine will be here soon.

23:16.320 --> 23:17.350
Oh, really?

23:19.090 --> 23:22.150
Maybe I'll give them a Dema this time.

23:25.000 --> 23:25.370
Next Time

23:25.370 --> 23:28.270
Next Time
What is the Byakki and why
must she be sought after?

23:28.270 --> 23:31.670
Next Time
What do they see in this white oni?

23:31.670 --> 23:34.110
Next Time
The mysteries will finally be revealed.

23:34.110 --> 23:34.370
Next Time

23:34.370 --> 23:35.040
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Pursues."

23:35.040 --> 23:36.540
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Pursues
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Pursues."

23:36.540 --> 23:36.780
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Pursues

23:36.780 --> 23:39.450
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Pursues
If we continue to search, we can find something.

23:39.450 --> 23:39.940
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Pursues
